    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="Translation"  TIER_ID="trx_en@SPK0032">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a226"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts12" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts15">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Who?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a227"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts22" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts26">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a228"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts27" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts34">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>A long time ago, I remember she used to say she and her family was building a sauna.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a229"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts35" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts44">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>How can I possibly know anyway.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a231"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts50" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts54">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Maybe ##.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a232"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts55" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts62">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Of couse they cannot not have a sauna (that would be weird if they did not have one).</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a234"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts65" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts71">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They probably do have one.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a235"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts74" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts81">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That big tree... I remember it was just two months old but it is still there these days, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a240"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts100" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts114">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The tip of it is withering and ###.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a244"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts124" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts130">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh yeah?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a248"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts142" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts145">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a249"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts163" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts173">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If they cut them down, it is firewood for them. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a250"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts176" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts199">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They say they don't take down the tree because it is located close to the electrical system. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a260"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts263" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts272">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>As you know, the big person who can do this job is there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a270"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts343" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts358">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He complains that his children are too young. And look at his mother, sitting and saying that he does not even have a job.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a272"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts362" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts374">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She transfers her pension to that person.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a275"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts378" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts381">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If she does so, then what will she be left with?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a278"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts402" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts413">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then they said that they were thinking about buying one more cow. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a279"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts420" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts431">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He says he held # in the morning.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a281"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts428" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts437">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Moldagali said, "I go out and I just look at my front and back". </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a282"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts440" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts443">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In the past, once when I was running after two calfs like that...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a283"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts450" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts472">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then I said, "There are many cows in the village. There are many cows in Sashke's house, people say, and there are many animals like that are for sale."  </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a285"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts475" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts483">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>From something trustworthy.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a288"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts498" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts501">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>From someone trustworthy.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a289"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts520" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts523">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Nuke says, "It is so hot in Kurshim".</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a290"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts526" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts533">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He says it is searing hot in there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a292"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts540" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts543">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Alright.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a293"
